[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Collite/kp-toy/pulls/1","id":5294072201,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVs9Hh88AAAABO40hiQ","html_url":"https://github.com/Collite/kp-toy/pull/1","diff_url":"https://github.com/Collite/kp-toy/pull/1.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Collite/kp-toy/pull/1.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Collite/kp-toy/issues/1","number":1,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"TOY S0.1: scaffold the Kotlin JVM library","user":{"login":"BoraPerusic","id":2312638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2312638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraPerusic","html_url":"https://github.com/BoraPerusic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraPerusic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraPerusic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraPerusic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraPerusic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraPerusic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraPerusic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraPerusic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraPerusic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraPerusic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Stage\n\nTOY-kp-toy-P0 · S0.1 — The skeleton. List: `keporkak-project/toy/tasks-p0-s0.1-skeleton.md`.\n\n## What landed\n\n- T1 — Three readable acceptance specs for the single library jar, passing placeholder on JVM 21 and exact catalog pins, plus two catalog-policy tests.\n- T2 — An empty `lib` module, JVM 21, exact catalog pins and a checksum-verified Gradle 8.14.3 wrapper; an independent report guard rejects zero executed specs (B1), and catalog edits invalidate the test task (B2).\n- T3 — `just build`, `just test` and `just check`; `check` also runs JDK-only build regressions outside JUnit discovery.\n- T4 — GitHub Actions runs `just check` on every pull request and push, including master.\n- T5 — README purpose/build instructions and the two AGENTS pointers to the toy plan and Keporkak rulebook.\n- T6 — Build output ignores and a verified clean clone with a fresh Gradle cache and no installed Gradle.\n\n## DONE line\n\n- [x] `just check` is green locally and in CI on the PR's head — **the library builds into one jar** and **the placeholder spec runs and passes** in [SkeletonSpec.kt](https://github.com/Collite/kp-toy/blob/028e9e2dece9c94f65f3c0da144e6f2ce3c9f013/lib/src/test/kotlin/org/collite/kptoy/SkeletonSpec.kt); **the build fails when the lib test task executes zero specs** in [BuildRegressions.java](https://github.com/Collite/kp-toy/blob/028e9e2dece9c94f65f3c0da144e6f2ce3c9f013/checks/BuildRegressions.java) prevents a green empty run (B1).\n- [x] after the merge, CI is green on master — [master CI run 43579750219](https://github.com/Collite/kp-toy/actions/runs/43579750219) passed on merge commit `25d4f09bb1b5041db31fe59eb68e07463248280e`.\n- [x] the version catalog has no dynamic version — **the version catalog has no dynamic version** in [SkeletonSpec.kt](https://github.com/Collite/kp-toy/blob/028e9e2dece9c94f65f3c0da144e6f2ce3c9f013/lib/src/test/kotlin/org/collite/kptoy/SkeletonSpec.kt), with [catalog policy cases](https://github.com/Collite/kp-toy/blob/028e9e2dece9c94f65f3c0da144e6f2ce3c9f013/lib/src/test/kotlin/org/collite/kptoy/CatalogPinsTest.kt) and the unused dynamic-alias build regression (B2).\n\n## Verified\n\n- `just check` locally → 5 JVM tests passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped; 3 independent build regressions passed; one `lib/build/libs/lib.jar`.\n- `just check` in a clean clone, with a fresh Gradle cache and PATH limited to JDK 21, just and OS tools → the same 5 JVM tests and 3 build regressions passed; clean Git status with global ignore rules disabled.\n- Red before repair: `java checks/BuildRegressions.java` failed all 3 probes because disabled discovery, absent test sources and unused `foo = \"1.+\"` incorrectly built successfully. After repair, each mutated build fails for its expected reason and the regression runner passes.\n- The source-removal and dynamic-alias regressions mutate initially green fixtures without cleaning; additionally verified disabling JUnit Platform after a green run rejects stale report reuse.\n- [PR CI run 43419756768](https://github.com/Collite/kp-toy/actions/runs/43419756768) → 5 JVM tests and 3 build regressions passed on `028e9e2dece9c94f65f3c0da144e6f2ce3c9f013`; [push CI run 43419748450](https://github.com/Collite/kp-toy/actions/runs/43419748450) also green.\n\n- Post-merge `just check` on master → 5 JVM tests and 3 build regressions passed; [CI run 43579750219](https://github.com/Collite/kp-toy/actions/runs/43579750219) on `25d4f09bb1b5041db31fe59eb68e07463248280e`.\n\n## Not in this stage\n\n- Out of scope: any parsing or formatting (S1.1, S1.2); the `consumer` and `demo` modules (S1.2, S1.3); publishing\n  anything; a container image.\n\n## Found while doing\n\n- The list names no spec seam; the specs observe Gradle’s library jar output and test runner, with the placeholder checking JVM 21.\n\n- KP S0.2 was not merged at branch time (master 75d8539 has no catalog); this fixture pins Kotlin 2.2.21, JUnit 5.13.4 / Platform 1.13.4 and Gradle 8.14.3 independently.\n\n- CI run 43410241181 passes but warns that checkout/setup-java v4 and setup-crate target deprecated Node 20 (forced to Node 24), and that setup-java v4 is deprecated.\n- The DONE item “after the merge, CI is green on master” can only be verified after Bora’s merge; it remains pending at the review hand-off.\n\n- B2’s catalog spec accepts the fixture’s single-line literal pins and version.ref declarations; other declaration forms fail closed.\n","created_at":"2026-11-13T10:41:50Z","updated_at":"2026-11-14T09:20:34Z","closed_at":"2026-11-14T09:16:10Z","merged_at"